// Minimal pseudo: enqueue checks current ring; if resize flag set, retry on old ring; otherwise place item in slot with atomic seq increment; dequeue reads with seq check; resize allocates new_ring, CAS to swap, migrates in-flight items, then defers old_ring reclamation.
```

